						<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="http://pressroblox.wordpress.com/2011/06/14/quick-facts/" title="Permalink to Quick&nbsp;facts!" rel="bookmark">Quick&nbsp;facts!</a></h1>
			
						<div class="entry-meta">
				<span class="sep">Posted on </span><a href="http://pressroblox.wordpress.com/2011/06/14/quick-facts/" title="4:06 pm" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2011-06-14T16:06:04+00:00" pubdate>June 14, 2011</time></a><span class="by-author"> <span class="sep"> by </span> <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="http://pressroblox.wordpress.com/author/pressroblox/" title="View all posts by pressroblox" rel="author">pressroblox</a></span></span>			</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
			
						<div class="comments-link">
				<a href="http://pressroblox.wordpress.com/2011/06/14/quick-facts/#respond" title="Comment on Quick&nbsp;facts!"><span class="leave-reply">Reply</span></a>			</div>
					</header><!-- .entry-header -->

				<div class="entry-content">
			<p>As of June 2, 2011, <a title="Free Games on ROBLOX" href="http://www.roblox.com" target="_blank">ROBLOX</a> had over 13.6 million accounts and 250,000 paying customers!</p>
<p>In the last year, we&#8217;ve seen a 75% YoY increase in revenues.</p>
<p><strong>April 2011 metrics:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>ROBLOX is the #3 Kids site on comScore, as measured by Total Minutes Played</li>
<li>5.7 million unique visitors</li>
<li>19 million hours played</li>
<li>717 million page views</li>
</ul>
